        {
          "tag": "h2",
          "text": "Signature Cocktails",
          "where": "main"
        },
        {
          "tag": "p",
          "text": "Crafted by some of the industry's finest, our cocktails may or may not give you superpowers.",
          "where": "main"
        },
        {
          "tag": "p",
          "text": "Whether you're craving a perfectly balanced classic, a modern tiki creation, or something completely off-menu, our bartenders are happy to craft a cocktail tailored to your tastes. Every drink is made with premium spirits, fresh ingredients, and a healthy dose of creativity.",
          "where": "main"
        },
        {
          "tag": "p",
          "text": "So grab a seat, soak in the tropical vibes, and enjoy great cocktails, great company, and an unforgettable experience. We look forward to sharing a drink—and maybe even a story—with you.",
          "where": "main"
        },
        {
          "tag": "h2",
          "text": "About Us",
          "where": "main"
        },
        {
          "tag": "p",
          "text": "Pineapple Club is a premier and authentic cocktail bar & restaurant that has been proudly serving the New York's East Village since 2020.",
          "where": "main"
        },
